{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Path of Master is built with Unreal Engine 5. The gameplay blends survival, Musou, and bullet\u2011hell elements. We\u2019ve removed the usual roguelike pause\u2011to\u2011select\u2011skill mechanic and now upgrade skills on the fly by picking up skill cubes at the right moment. Your weapon has two interchangeable attack modes; using a special attack sacrifices your normal attack. After surviving the first four stages, Hell Island unlocks\u2014granting massive gold but far tougher challenges. Survive ten minutes there to earn a powerful hidden perk.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668480?t=1745504849","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668480?t=1745504849","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668480/90cd91ff3cdc79783ad7c3744bee0d1b35126cef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745504849","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668480/90cd91ff3cdc79783ad7c3744bee0d1b35126cef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745504849","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Path of Master is built with Unreal Engine 5. The gameplay blends survival, Musou, and bullet\u2011hell elements. We\u2019ve removed the usual roguelike pause\u2011to\u2011select\u2011skill mechanic and now upgrade skills on the fly by picking up skill cubes at the right moment. Your weapon has two interchangeable attack modes; using a special attack sacrifices your normal attack. After surviving the first four stages, Hell Island unlocks\u2014granting massive gold but far tougher challenges. Survive ten minutes there to earn a powerful hidden perk.</p>","developers